  m_text: '<b>Tap the Bevel button or the Blocks button to change the edge behavior.</b>


    Changing the edge behavior determines when an active tangible UI decides to re-orient
    itself based on its position. Bevel mode works well for content that is centered
    on the tangible. Blocks mode works well when content is offset from the center
    of the tangible (like the tangible UI in this example).'
